# Generated, never committed (R8.7).
#
# scripts/scrub-gitconfig.sh writes gitconfig.d/.gitconfig here from the operator's own
# host gitconfig. Even scrubbed of credential.helper it is the operator's personal
# configuration -- name, email, signing keys, remotes -- and it is derived material that
# every checkout regenerates before `docker compose up`. Nothing in this directory is
# this repository's to carry.
#
# Deny everything, keep only this file. An allowlist rather than a pattern list, so a
# future generated artifact is ignored by default instead of by remembering to add it.
*
!.gitignore
